    "teaserText": "Javelins and energy",
    "startText": "[singing optimistic]Aaah the army. They offer steady meals, regular wages and the opportunity to meet entirely new people who disliked him.\n[long pause]\nThe recruiting officer listened to Anthony's grand ambitions with the weary expression of a man who had heard a hundred fools promise to conquer the world before breakfast.\n\n[mad drunk officer]\"Can you throw a javelin?\"\n\n[joyfull]Anthony said he could.\n\n[bored]The officer grunts and points to targets [mumbles silently]...[inaudible mambojabmo]",
    "winText": "[excited] The javelin struck its target. \n\nThe recruiting officer gave a grunt of approval, [sarcastic]as though Anthony had merely managed not to embarrass him.\n\n[enthousiastic]Anthony had been accepted into the army. [optimistic]At last, a respectable career lay before him.\n[long pause]\n[mysterious] Little did he know that the gods had a rather different meaning of glory in mind. [content]And they had a wicked sense of humour.",
    "loseText": "A javelin is not a walking stick, and throwing it at random is not a recognised military discipline. The officer walks away as he has other recruits to disappoint.",
